<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88047" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόμοιρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῖρα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>before the destined term,</i> i.e. <i>untimely,</i>
			of death, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				1.276
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>doomed to untimely death,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				11.159
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>); in epitaphs, <i>dead before their time, Epigr.
				Gr.</i><i><span class="en">
				418
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1386.3
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Alba</span>), <i><span class="en">
				1521
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rome</span>). Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				1932
			</span></i> (ibid.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>BMus.Inscr.</u>
				794.10
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cnidus</span>).</div>
